flowchart TD
    A[Start Cycle Runner] --> B{Single-flight lock free?}
    B -- No --> Z[Exit: another cycle active]
    B -- Yes --> C[Run ONE chat session]
    C --> D[Capture transcript + exit code + duration]
    D --> E{Outcome classifier}
    E -- Success: all todos done + tests pass --> F[Stage + report COMMITTABLE]
    F --> Z2[Exit 0]
    E -- Incomplete todos / test fail / crash / hang --> G[Record failure to ledger]
    G --> H{Attempt <= 6?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Immediate retry, no steering]
    I --> C
    H -- No --> J{Attempt == 7?}
    J -- Yes --> K[Immediate retry + steering comment]
    K --> C
    J -- No --> L{Near-immediate failure?}
    L -- No --> M[Reset ladder to Phase 0]
    M --> C
    L -- Yes --> N[Advance backoff ladder]
    N --> O[P2: 15s x 5min]
    O --> P[P3: 60s x 45min]
    P --> Q[P4: 120s x 2h]
    Q --> R[P5: 180s x 3h]
    R --> S[P6: 300s x 48h]
    S --> T[Exhausted: write final report]
    T --> Z3[Exit 1]
    O --> C
    P --> C
    Q --> C
    R --> C
    S --> C
